     "title": "Deployment from the command line",
     "minutes": 3,
     "source": "",
     "task": "In namespace `arch-c`, create a Deployment `firstdeploy` with image `nginx:1.27`, 3 replicas, and container port 80. Record the name of the ReplicaSet it created into `/tmp/firstdeploy-rs.txt`.",
     "solution": "```bash\nk create ns arch-c\nk -n arch-c create deployment firstdeploy --image=nginx:1.27 --replicas=3 --port=80\nk -n arch-c get rs -l app=firstdeploy -o jsonpath='{.items[0].metadata.name}' > /tmp/firstdeploy-rs.txt\n```",
